     "body": "<p>Set to pending; needs discussion.</p>\n\n<p>Things have changed since this feature was entered.  Need to decide what the roadmap for direct Mulgara/MPTStore integration looks like.  Regardless of such decision, I'm not sure what's described here would qualify as a \"feature\".</p>",
